Date: Sun, 21 Jun 2026 04:43:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] art(SKU-52): theme-color machine overlays (front/side/top) +
 emissive accents

Recolor the 4 singleblock machines' static overlays into per-machine palettes
(normis=green filter, cnc=steel+amber, pot_distillery=copper, vibe_stabilizer=indigo/cyan)
with the brightest tier as an emissive accent. Layouts preserved (model-aligned).
